 Notes: SIAM's data-science activity group calls MDS biennial in even year
 s (MDS22 Sep 26-30\, MDS24 Oct 21-25\, MDS26 Nov 16-20\, each Monday to F
 riday). As of 2026-10-31 no MDS28 dates\, host or call are published\, an
 d the SIAM participation system has no mds28 code. Meeting dates and the 
 proposal and poster-abstract cutoffs (11:59 pm ET) are same-weekday two-y
 ear proxies from MDS26 (Apr 20 and May 18\, 2026)\; timing has drifted la
 ter each edition. MDS24 and MDS26 took contributed posters but no contrib
 uted lectures. Presentation abstracts only\, non-archival. Size is an edi
 torial estimate.
